我要把所有关于排球的内容都拆解一下。

794
00:37:23.860 --> 00:37:24.440
All right.
我喜欢你们提出的所有这些问题。

795
00:37:24.580 --> 00:37:26.080
I'm going to break down all the volleyball.
我喜欢它们，因为你们知道，其中一些问题的答案我知道，而其他的让我很感兴趣。

796
00:37:26.280 --> 00:37:27.860
I love all these questions, you guys.
我打过很多排球。

797
00:37:28.020 --> 00:37:32.540
I love them because you know I know the answer to some of them and others I'm intrigued.
真看不出来。

798
00:37:32.960 --> 00:37:34.340
I have played a lot of volleyball.
我真的打过。

799
00:37:34.740 --> 00:37:35.760
You don't say.
是啊。

800
00:37:36.140 --> 00:37:36.900
I have.
我打过。

801
00:37:37.460 --> 00:37:37.980
When?
什么时候？

802
00:37:38.420 --> 00:37:40.580
In, like, grade school.
大概小学的时候吧。

803
00:37:40.780 --> 00:37:41.160
Your youth?
你的青春期？

804
00:37:41.160 --> 00:37:41.760
High school.
高中。

805
00:37:41.880 --> 00:37:42.140
Okay.
好吧。

806
00:37:42.320 --> 00:37:43.840
My youth at the beach.
我在海滩度过的青春时光。

807
00:37:43.980 --> 00:37:45.800
I know how to play volleyball.
我会打排球。

808
00:37:46.080 --> 00:37:48.900
And I have a really great underhand serve.
而且我的下手发球特别稳。

809
00:37:49.060 --> 00:37:49.780
So do I.
我也是。

810
00:37:49.940 --> 00:37:50.800
Very consistent.
非常稳定。

811
00:37:51.060 --> 00:37:51.160
Yes.
没错。

812
00:37:51.160 --> 00:37:53.140
Nothing fancy, but we'll always get in.
没什么花哨的，但总能发过去。

813
00:37:53.220 --> 00:37:53.600
Same.
一样。

814
00:37:54.040 --> 00:37:55.520
They didn't want that for Pam.
他们不想让帕姆那样。

815
00:37:55.700 --> 00:37:56.780
I offered to do it.
我主动提出要那样做。

816
00:37:56.900 --> 00:37:57.680
They weren't interested.
他们没兴趣。

817
00:37:57.900 --> 00:37:59.620
They wanted overhand serve.
他们想要的是上手发球。

818
00:37:59.920 --> 00:38:01.660
Because you know in varsity high school,
因为你知道在高中校队里，

819
