你必须得上手发球。

820
00:38:03.020 --> 00:38:04.040
I did not know that.
我不知道这一点。

821
00:38:04.200 --> 00:38:05.460
I did not play varsity.
我没进过校队。

822
00:38:05.600 --> 00:38:07.680
I know this because my daughter's playing volleyball.
我知道这个是因为我女儿在打排球。

823
00:38:07.880 --> 00:38:08.520
She is.
是啊。

824
00:38:08.600 --> 00:38:10.960
In junior high, she can still do underhand,
在初中，她还可以下手发球，

825
