但他们已经要求她们练习上手发球了。

826
00:38:13.620 --> 00:38:14.840
Well, here was the problem.
嗯，问题就在这儿。

827
00:38:15.460 --> 00:38:17.120
I have a shoulder injury.
我的肩膀有伤。

828
00:38:17.260 --> 00:38:20.220
I have tendinitis in my right shoulder, and it's really bad.
我右肩有肌腱炎，非常严重。

829
00:38:20.380 --> 00:38:23.540
And I have a sort of, like, lack of range of motion.
而且我的活动范围受限。

830
00:38:23.960 --> 00:38:28.860
And doing that overhead swoopy motion, it's even a little sore.
做那种上手挥臂的动作，甚至会有点疼。

831
00:38:28.920 --> 00:38:29.700
I'm doing it now.
我现在做这个动作都疼。

832
00:38:29.700 --> 00:38:33.680
It's even a little bit sore if I'm holding nothing in my hand
哪怕我手里什么都没拿，

833
00:38:33.680 --> 00:38:36.000
