They shouldn't have even auditioned me for that role.
他们根本就不该让我去试镜那个角色。

852
00:39:17.940 --> 00:39:19.820
There's no way I could have swung on a rope.
我根本不可能抓着绳子荡过去。

853
00:39:21.260 --> 00:39:22.360
All right, well, listen.
好吧，听着。

854
00:39:22.800 --> 00:39:24.680
They had to get me a stunt double.
他们不得不给我找了个替身。

855
00:39:24.680 --> 00:39:29.440
Her name was Nancy McCrum, and Randy was kind enough
她叫南希·麦克拉姆，兰迪很贴心地

856
00:39:29.440 --> 00:39:31.320
